<title>USA: Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.29		    $1.49</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 2.27		     1.47</p>
<p> Net			445,000		  303,000</p>
<p> Net revs	     3,382,000		2,613,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     189,400		  195,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     190,700		  195,100</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 fourth quarter net income after $40 million pre-tax charge from resolution Olympia &amp; York bankruptcy.  </p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 fourth quarter net income also after $155 million pre-tax gain from sale of one-third of a minority interest in Bloomberg LP.</p>
<p>				YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary		$8.20		    $5.44</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 8.06		     5.42</p>
<p> Net		    1,619,000		1,114,000</p>
<p> Net revs	    13,116,000	     10,265,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     191,800		  196,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     195,200		  196,700</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
